   \code{on} \tab with \code{term} \tab prediction mode \cr
   \code{"test"} (default) \tab coefficient estimated on the test samples \tab fitted on the training samples, scored on the test samples \cr
   \code{"train"} \tab estimated on the training samples \tab cross-validated within the training samples \cr
   \code{"all"} \tab estimated on all samples \tab cross-validated over all samples \cr
